        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075870/extras/102ef5234b6e0c2c011ca2320cd1f1b5.poster.avif?t=1770021986\" width=608 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075870/extras/102ef5234b6e0c2c011ca2320cd1f1b5.webm?t=1770021986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075870/extras/102ef5234b6e0c2c011ca2320cd1f1b5.mp4?t=1770021986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baron Mortimort wants to get rid of his cat... <strong>YOU</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to escape his <strong>mysterious manor</strong> as quickly as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each room, choose the correct door by <strong>finding the clue</strong> present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But <strong>be quick</strong>, as you only have 1 minute per room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t give up and attempt to navigate through the manor’s <strong>60 rooms</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 rooms spread across 3 biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over fifty puzzle variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Casual Mode (5 minutes of exploration per room)</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075870/extras/102ef5234b6e0c2c011ca2320cd1f1b5.poster.avif?t=1770021986\" width=608 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075870/extras/102ef5234b6e0c2c011ca2320cd1f1b5.webm?t=1770021986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075870/extras/102ef5234b6e0c2c011ca2320cd1f1b5.mp4?t=1770021986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baron Mortimort wants to get rid of his cat... <strong>YOU</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to escape his <strong>mysterious manor</strong> as quickly as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each room, choose the correct door by <strong>finding the clue</strong> present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But <strong>be quick</strong>, as you only have 1 minute per room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t give up and attempt to navigate through the manor’s <strong>60 rooms</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 rooms spread across 3 biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over fifty puzzle variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Casual Mode (5 minutes of exploration per room)</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "The Infinite Manor is a puzzle and speed game (die &amp; retry) where you must escape the mysterious manor of Baron Mortimort. In each room, choose the correct door using the hidden clue.",
